        "---\n",
        "title: \"common-slide-things\"\n",
        "format: revealjs\n",
        "editor: source\n",
        "---\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "Alt text in plot output:\n",
        "#| fig-alt: \"...\"\n",
        "\n",
        "Alt text for image file:\n",
        "![Caption for the image](path/to/image.png){fig-alt=\"Descriptive text for screen readers\"}\n",
        "## Centered title {.center-h2}\n",
        "<br>\n",
        "\n",
        "```{css}\n",
        ".center-h2 h2 {\n",
        "  text-align: center;\n",
        "}\n",
        "```\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "## Columns\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.columns}\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\"}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: \n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Incremental columns\n",
        "::: {.columns}\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\" .fragment}\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "::: {.column width=\"50%\" .fragment}\n",
        "\n",
        "::: \n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Panel tabset\n",
        "\n",
        "::: {.panel-tabset}\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Incremental list\n",
        "::: {.incremental}\n",
        "\n",
        ":::\n",
        "\n",
        "## Highlight code lines\n",
        "\n",
        "#| code-line-numbers: \"\"\n",
        "\n",
        "\n",
        "## Footnotes\n",
        "\n",
        "Here is a footnote reference,[^1] and another.[^longnote]\n",
        "\n",
        "[^1]: Here is the footnote.\n",
        "\n",
        "[^longnote]: Here's one with multiple blocks.\n",
        "\n",
        "    Subsequent paragraphs are indented to show that they belong to the previous footnote.\n",
        "\n",
        "        { some.code }\n",
        "\n",
        "    The whole paragraph can be indented, or just the first line. \n",
        "    In this way, multi-paragraph footnotes work like multi-paragraph list items.\n",
        "\n",
        "This paragraph won't be part of the note, because it isn't indented."
      ],
